@startuml
title US086 - Pilot Remote Access

actor Pilot
participant "Remote Client App" as Client
participant "TCP Remote Server" as Server
participant "RemoteAccessDispatcher" as Dispatcher
participant "Authentication Handler" as AuthHandler
participant "Pilot Request Handler" as PilotHandler
participant "FlightPlanController" as Controller
database "Remote RDBMS" as DB
participant "Remote Access Logging Server" as Logger

Pilot -> Client: Enter credentials
Client -> Server: TCP Packet opCode 1\nusername;password
Server -> Dispatcher: Dispatch authentication packet
Dispatcher -> AuthHandler: authenticate(credentials)
AuthHandler -> DB: Validate user credentials
DB --> AuthHandler: User/session result
AuthHandler --> Dispatcher: Authentication response
Dispatcher --> Server: Success or error packet

alt successful Pilot authentication
    Server -> Server: Store authenticated connection context
    Server -> Logger: UDP login success event\nservice=US86
    Server --> Client: TCP success response
else failed authentication or unauthorized role
    Server -> Logger: UDP login failure event\nservice=US86
    Server --> Client: TCP error response
end

Pilot -> Client: Select Pilot operation
Client -> Server: TCP Pilot operation packet
Server -> Server: Verify authenticated Pilot context
Server -> Dispatcher: Dispatch Pilot packet
Dispatcher -> PilotHandler: Execute remote operation
PilotHandler -> Controller: Invoke Pilot use case
Controller -> DB: Read/write data
DB --> Controller: Result
Controller --> PilotHandler: Use case result
PilotHandler --> Dispatcher: Response packet
Dispatcher --> Server: Response packet
Server --> Client: TCP response
Client --> Pilot: Show result

Pilot -> Client: Logout
Client -> Server: TCP Packet opCode 0
Server -> Logger: UDP logout event\nservice=US86
Server --> Client: TCP logout confirmation
Server -> Server: Close connection

... abrupt disconnect ...
Server -> Logger: UDP disconnect event\nservice=US86

@enduml
